{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spudtoon: Born to Peel</strong> is a ridiculous, root-powered 2.5D roguelike twin stick shooter where heroic potatoes rise up against their crunchy carrot overlords. Dive into a procedurally generated battlefield of mud, madness, and mayhem, where every run is a new chance to starch up and serve some serious side dish smackdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your gear, call in your co-op comrades, and roll into battle as a Spud with attitude. From frying pans to mashed-launchers, you\u2019ll peel your way through waves of carrot commandos, orange parsnip punks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath Mechanic: Experience intense, high-stakes gameplay where death is permanent, making every decision crucial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 unique Weapons: Equip yourself with a diverse arsenal of weapons,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Hazards: Navigate through treacherous terrain and avoid environmental hazards that can be as deadly as the Carrot Commandos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Levels: Encounter a new challenge every time with procedurally generated levels that keep the game play fresh and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Battles: Confront powerful <strong>carrot\u00a0</strong>bosses that require strategic thinking and precise execution to defeat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the odds with split screen 2 Player CO OP.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two runs are the same. No carrot is safe.<br>You were born to peel \u2014 now <strong>act like it</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highl